This independent Python implementation ports the protocol and fixed subtitle
defaults from xifan2333/jianying-subtitle, commit
b14e42cfd29a9e829a4b5a2edb75166ced89de12 (version 0.2.3).
Upstream: https://github.com/xifan2333/jianying-subtitle
